    "type": "question",
    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "The maximum temperature for Thredbo today was $-8^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$, while Mount Kosciusko had a top temperature of $-24.3^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$. How much warmer than Mount Kosciusko was Thredbo today?",
