      "short": "$16.3^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$ warmer.",
      "worked": "$\\begin{align*}-8-(-24.3)&=-8+24.3\\\\&=16.3\\end{align*}$\n\nThredbo was $16.3^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$ warmer.",
